# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GTM-Teardowns
# Written analysis only. No build output and no dependencies, so this file
# exists for one reason: to keep working material out of published history.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Working files.
# These may contain material that must never be published, including
# compensation figures, rate cards, unsent drafts, and findings that have not
# yet been sent to the company they concern.
/drafts/
/working/
/private/
*.private.md
*.draft.md
NOTES.md
PRE-PUBLISH*.md

# Captured source material from a review.
# Page captures are useful evidence and are usually too large to version.
/captures/
/raw-fetches/
*.har
*.warc

# Operating system
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Temporary files from word processors and PDF readers
~$*
*.tmp

# Environment files, in case any tooling is added later
.env
.env.local
